[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: The Board canvas renders compact cards over a pan-and-zoom scene

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[MECHANISM]
UID: MECH-SDOC-BOARD-CANVAS
TITLE: The Board canvas renders compact cards over a pan-and-zoom scene
DEPTH: implemented
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
board.js renders the snapshot as SVG card groups over a pan-and-zoom scene:
cards show type, UID, title and state; edges show the declared role and an
arrow; pointer and wheel transforms provide pan, zoom and fit. Clicking a card
emphasizes its immediate incoming and outgoing relations and fills a read-only
inspector with every field, the declaring file's path, and both relation
directions resolved to titles. The shell (app.js) fetches the snapshot and
calls renderBoard; the view module fetches nothing itself.
<<<
NOTES: >>>
Ported 2026-09-01 from the codex spike unchanged in substance; the fetch moved
into the shell and the type accents moved onto the shared Aurora palette.
<<<
